        "description": {
          "text": "Added LONSURF in combination with bevacizumab for adult patients with previously treated metastatic colorectal cancer",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "*LONSURF, as a single agent or in combination with bevacizumab, is indicated for the treatment of adult patients with metastatic colorectal cancer previously treated with fluoropyrimidine-, oxaliplatin- and irinotecan-based chemotherapy, an anti-VEGF biological therapy, and if RAS wild-type, an anti-EGFR therapy.*",
              "doc_id": "b0bc2f21-f947-5cae-be31-40f8fdac47c4",
              "line": 6
